        "description": "All queried turns/endpoints before interpolation: start (0,0), rise-to-flat (6,5), flat-to-fall (14,5), stop (16,0). Constant v=5 segment spans exactly t=6 through t=14. No curve beyond t=16 or before t=0.\nSolid stroke, rising arm mildly bent, plateau horizontal, falling arm bent and steep; preserve these as traced segments, not a straight-line model or smooth regularized curve. No curve arrows, labeled points, open/closed endpoint disks or dashed strokes.\nIntermediate visual readings have finite stroke uncertainty, not exact queried values: t=1 about v=1, t=2 about 1.8, t=3 about 2.6, t=4 about 3.4, t=5 about 4.2; on fall t=14.5 about 3.3, t=15 about 1.9 and t=15.5 about 0.6.",
